      "type": "constructed_response",
      "stem_html": "<section class=\"exam-shared-context\">二、非选择题：本题共5小题，共60分。</section><br>13. 一列简谐横波沿<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/745ca2df158303a54cab.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\"> 轴传播，波速为<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/36233bc32fdb9cf1f3f4.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">。t=0 时刻的波形图如图所示，此时<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/9b3f4cb8a8e706f9c8cb.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">处的质点P 的振动方向沿<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/645f06ab39a90e6f714a.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\"> 轴负方向，<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/953466eb727cd3daa838.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">和<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/8bfc460f957f271557a9.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">处的质点均处于平衡位置。<br><img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-figure-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/ad17148a5121d1c3986e.png\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\"><br>（1）求波的传播方向、波长<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/2dcce07c674241502053.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">和周期<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/d8022570dd916dea4207.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\"> 。<br>（2）从t=0 时刻开始，经多长时间质点P 第二次到达平衡位置？",
